OBJECTVE;

1> To represent an EV charging network using a graph.

2>To represent charging stations as vertices and connections as edges.

3>To implement the Depth First Search (DFS) algorithm in C++.

4>To explore the network starting from a user-selected charging station.

5>To display all stations reached during DFS traversal.

6>To identify unreachable or isolated charging stations.

7>To understand the practical application of graph traversal in EV charging infrastructure.
